OL,3,ADoctor accused of 1994 Rwanda genocide
OL,4,Aoffences to face trial in UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FA doctor accused of a number of
OL,7,Foffences relating to the 1994 Rwanda
OL,8,Fgenocide is set to face trial in autumn
OL,9,Fnext year.
OL,11,FDr Vincent Brown, formerly Dr Vincent
OL,12,FBajinya, 65, is accused of "killing,
OL,13,Fdirecting or encouraging" the deaths of
OL,14,Fmembers of the Tutsi ethnic group in
OL,15,FRwanda. He is the first person in the
OL,16,FUK to have been charged over the
OL,17,Fgenocide.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
