OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ADoctor accused of 1994 Rwanda genocide
OL,4,Aoffences to face trial in UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrown, of Islington, north London, is
OL,7,Fcharged with one count of conduct
OL,8,Fancillary to genocide and six offences
OL,9,Fof conduct ancillary to murder as a
OL,10,Fcrime against humanity.
OL,12,FA judge has now set his provisional
OL,13,Ftrial date to begin in October 2027. He
OL,14,Fdenies wrongdoing and has not yet
OL,15,Fentered a plea.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
